  "about": "Official TCG names for cards that the card databases still file under another name. YGOPRODeck, the Supabase cards table and BabelCDB keep a new set's cards under their OCG translations until the TCG release catches up, and ProjectIgnis scripts them under a pre-release code (pre-release/c<prerelease>.lua). scripts/lib/card-engine.mjs reads this file to load each TCG name with the pre-release card data (from assets/data/cardscripts/babel-prerelease/*.cdb) and script; assets/js/card-loader.js reads it to find a card's record by its other name or passcode when its TCG name isn't listed yet. Add a set's cards here when a page uses their TCG names. An entry whose passcode has its own ProjectIgnis row in cards.cdb is no longer needed for the engine.",
